  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Integrating the UN SDGs into WTO Law (2025), published by Springer Nature, has been cited 1 time. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 197 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Integrating the UN SDGs into WTO Law by Xinyan Zhao was published by Springer Nature in 2025. It is part of the European yearbook of international economic law series. Conceptually, the work connects to Political science, Law and economics, Law, Environmental ethics and Economics.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation. Notable citing venues include State Society and Development PMPD Perspectives. The citing authors are based in China.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 197 times via OAPEN. Open Library reports a combined count of 1 reading logs and catalog editions. Its subject matter aligns with Peace, Justice and strong institutions among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
